1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Both networks have two leaders, but one has an extra nonleader.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
A new center sends its old matching memory before learning its new information.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The designated leaders still see identical histories.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
The relay delays the difference: the leader views still match through round five.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
At round six the leader views diverge. Before then, the sizes were indistinguishable.
